---
/**
 * Small "In the book" tag for list items whose post was adapted into, or
 * inspired a chapter of, Open and Async (front matter `bookRelation`). Used in
 * reading lists so the list itself shows how much of it the book covers.
 * Book promo colors (navy and lime) per DESIGN.md's Book Object Rule.
 * stripMdxSyntax drops it from text outputs (.md, feed, email).
 */
---

<span class="not-prose ml-1.5 inline-block whitespace-nowrap rounded bg-brand-950 px-1.5 py-px align-[0.1em] font-mono text-[0.65rem] font-semibold uppercase leading-normal tracking-wider text-accent-400">In the book</span>
